{"id":"L-meta-5397","title":"Rehousing a dirty AND in an AND/OR edge circuit: zero it, serve its lost edges by stars and widened tops; F kept, fewer dirty ANDs, at most the counted gates","formal_statement":"∀ (n : ℕ) (G : SimpleGraph (Fin n)) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (C : PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds.Circuit) (g : ℕ) (St : Finset (Fin n)) (O : Fin n → Finset ℕ) (Tp : Finset ℕ) (bt : ℕ → Fin 2) (U : ℕ → Finset (Fin n)) (Z Fo Dd : Finset ℕ), PEqualNP.TopForm.IsAO2 n C → PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.circuitFun n C = PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.NestedCover.graphFun G ∅ → g ∈ PEqualNP.TopForm.junk G C → (∀ c ∈ St, (O c).Nonempty ∧ ∀ w ∈ O c, (w < n ∨ (n ≤ w ∧ w - n < C.gates.length ∧ w - n ≠ g ∧ w - n ∉ Dd)) ∧ ∀ x : Fin n → Bool, PEqualNP.CleanedNonEdge.wireVal n C w x = true → ∃ q : Fin n, G.Adj c q ∧ x q = true) → (∀ T ∈ Tp, T < C.gates.length ∧ T ≠ g ∧ T ∉ Dd ∧ T ∉ Fo ∧ (PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.NestedCover.gateAt C T).op = PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds.GateOp.and ∧ PEqualNP.TopForm.BelowF G C T ∧ PEqualNP.CleanedNonEdge.OrReaches n C C.output T ∧ (U T).Nonempty ∧ ∀ u ∈ U T, ∀ x : Fin n → Bool, PEqualNP.CleanedNonEdge.wireVal n C (PEqualNP.TopForm.opnd C T (1 - bt T)) x = true → x u = true → PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.NestedCover.graphFun G ∅ x = true) → (∀ a b : Fin n, G.Adj a b → PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.circuitFun n ⟨C.gates.set g ⟨PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds.GateOp.or, []⟩, C.output⟩ (PEqualNP.EdgeOwnership.pairInput a b) = false → (∃ c ∈ St, (c = a ∨ c = b) ∧ ∃ w ∈ O c, PEqualNP.CleanedNonEdge.wireVal n ⟨C.gates.set g ⟨PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds.GateOp.or, []⟩, 0⟩ w (PEqualNP.EdgeOwnership.pairInput a b) = true) ∨ ∃ T ∈ Tp, PEqualNP.CleanedNonEdge.wireVal n ⟨C.gates.set g ⟨PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds.GateOp.or, []⟩, 0⟩ (PEqualNP.TopForm.opnd C T (1 - bt T)) (PEqualNP.EdgeOwnership.pairInput a b) = true ∧ ∃ t ∈ U T, t = a ∨ t = b) → (∀ j ∈ Z, j = g ∨ (j < C.gates.length ∧ j ∉ Dd ∧ j ∉ Tp ∧ (((PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.NestedCover.gateAt C j).op = PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds.GateOp.and ∧ ∃ i ∈ Z, n + i ∈ (PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.NestedCover.gateAt C j).inputs) ∨ ∀ w ∈ (PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.NestedCover.gateAt C j).inputs, ∃ i ∈ Z, w = n + i))) → (∀ j ∈ Fo, j < C.gates.length ∧ j ≠ g ∧ j ∉ Dd ∧ ∃ i ∈ Z, n + i ∈ (PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.NestedCover.gateAt C j).inputs) → (∀ j ∈ Dd, j < C.gates.length ∧ j ≠ g ∧ C.output ≠ n + j) → (∀ k < C.gates.length, k ≠ g → k ∉ Dd → ∀ j : ℕ, n + j ∈ (PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.NestedCover.gateAt C k).inputs → j ∉ Dd) → ∃ D : PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds.Circuit, PEqualNP.TopForm.IsAO2 n D ∧ PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.circuitFun n D = PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.NestedCover.graphFun G ∅ ∧ (PEqualNP.TopForm.junk G D).card < (PEqualNP.TopForm.junk G C).card ∧ D.size + 1 + Dd.card + Fo.card ≤ C.size + ∑ c ∈ St, ((O c).card + 1) + ∑ T ∈ Tp, (U T).card","statement_hash":"sha256:7e276485e228dd9115ea6c39ddd419a8d8b22e5508694b5a6adbbb67e1a2083a","plain_statement":"G a graph, F its edge function, C AND/OR (two earlier wires each, so only earlier wires) computing F, g a dirty AND. Zero g; each edge then lost is served by a star x_c AND OR(O c), c in St an end, O c wires below the OR of c's neighbours, true at the edge; or by a top T in Tp (AND below F, ORs to the output) with one operand widened by ends U(T), T's other operand AND x_u below F. Dd: gates nobody reads; Fo: gates reading wires the zero forces false. Then an AND/OR circuit computes F with fewer dirty ANDs and at most |C| - 1 - |Dd| - |Fo| + sum_St (|O c| + 1) + sum_Tp |U(T)| gates.","status":"checked","barrier":null,"depends_on":[],"program":"meta_complexity","seat":"seat-alg-1","proposed_at":"2026-11-24T22:58:14.657Z","attempts":[{"when":"2026-11-24T23:10:55.107Z","ended_at":"2026-11-24T23:10:55.107Z","by":"seat-alg-1","outcome":"checked","funded_by":{"kind":"baseline","name":"Brilliant"}}],"artifact":{"lean_file":"lean/PEqualNP/MetaComplexity/L5397.lean","checker_version":"check-lean 3, Lean 4.36.0, Mathlib fc4f59e577","checker_run_id":"run-048807","content_hash":"sha